                "userPrompt": "# 后端技术方案文档\n'''\n{{tech_doc}}\n'''\n\n# 仓库的架构说明书\n'''\n# runner-center 核心架构\n\n## 1. 技术栈\n\n| 类别 | 组件 | 版本 / 说明 |\n|------|------|------------|\n| 基础框架 | DongBoot（Spring Boot 增强封装） | 2.0.9 |\n| 运行时 | Java | 17 |\n| RPC 框架 | JSF | 通过 `@BootService` / `@BootReference` 暴露与引用服务 |\n| ORM | MyBatis-Plus | 3.5.13 |\n| 缓存 | JIMDB（Redis 协议） | 通过 DongBoot Jim 组件管理 |\n| 消息队列 | JMQ4 | 生产者/消费者分组配置 |\n| 配置中心 | DUCC | 通过 `@LafValue` 动态注入 |\n| 对象存储 | JOSS（ 云 OSS） | 通过 JossFactory 构建客户端 |\n| HTTP 客户端 | OkHttp（DongHttp 封装） | 默认 + 图谱分析专用实例 |\n| 定时任务 | schedule-dong-boot-starter | ThreadPoolTaskScheduler |\n| 安全认证 | SSO（ERP 单点登录） | sso-jakarta 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT |\n| AI 能力 | Spring AI MCP Server | ${spring.ai.verison} = 1.0.0 |\n| 工具库 | Hutool | 5.7.16 |\n| 参数校验 | Jakarta Validation | 3.0.2 |\n\n---\n\n## 2. 中间件组件\n\n### 2.1 JIMDB 分布式缓存\n\nJIMDB 是基于 Redis 协议的分布式缓存，通过 DongBoot Jim 组件统一管理连接。\n\n```java\n// 配置（JimConfiguration.java）\n@Configuration\npublic class JimConfiguration {\n    @Bean\n    @ConfigurationProperties(prefix = \"dong.jim.runner-center\")\n    public ConfigurableJimCluster runnerCenterJimCluster() {\n        return JimClusterBuilder.create().build();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n```properties\n# jimdb.properties（行云占位符注入）\ndong.jim.runner-center.service-endpoint = ${JIM_SERVICE_ENDPOINT}\ndong.jim.runner-center.jim-url          = ${JIM_URL}\n```\n\n### 2.2 JMQ4 消息队列\n\nJMQ4 提供异步消息生产与消费能力，通过 DongBoot 自动装配管理 Topic 与分组。\n\n```properties\n# jmq.properties（生产者/消费者分组配置）\ndong.jmq4.demo.topic=dongboot\ndong.jmq4.producers.producer1.name=${JMQ_PRODUCER1_GROUP}\ndong.jmq4.consumers.consumer1.name=${JMQ_CONSUMER1_GROUP}\n```\n\n### 2.3 MyBatis-Plus 分页插件\n\n注册 MyBatis-Plus 分页拦截器，配合 `@MapperScan` 实现自动分页。\n\n```java\n// 配置（MyBatisConfiguration.java）\n@Configuration\n@AutoConfigureAfter(DataSourceAutoConfiguration.class)\npublic class MyBatisConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    public MybatisPlusInterceptor mybatisPlusInterceptor() {\n        MybatisPlusInterceptor interceptor = new MybatisPlusInterceptor();\n        // 注册分页内置拦截器\n        interceptor.addInnerInterceptor(new PaginationInnerInterceptor());\n        return interceptor;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.4 OkHttp 客户端\n\n提供全局默认与业务专用两个 OkHttpClient 实例，隔离超时配置。\n\n```java\n// 配置（HttpClientConfig.java）\n@Configuration\npublic class HttpClientConfig {\n\n    // 默认全局复用客户端\n    @Primary\n    @Bean\n    public OkHttpClient okHttpClient() {\n        return DongHttp.okHttp().custom().build();\n    }\n\n    // 图谱分析专用客户端（readTimeout 120s）\n    @Bean(\"architectureOkHttpClient\")\n    public OkHttpClient architectureOkHttpClient() {\n        return new OkHttpClient.Builder()\n                .connectTimeout(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n                .readTimeout(120, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n                .writeTimeout(10, TimeUnit.SECONDS)\n                .build();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.5 定时任务调度器\n\n基于 Spring `ThreadPoolTaskScheduler` 提供统一的定时任务线程池，支持优雅停机。\n\n```java\n// 配置（SchedulingConfig.java）\n@Configuration\npublic class SchedulingConfig {\n\n    @Bean\n    public ThreadPoolTaskScheduler taskScheduler() {\n        ThreadPoolTaskScheduler scheduler = new ThreadPoolTaskScheduler();\n        scheduler.setPoolSize(5);\n        scheduler.setThreadNamePrefix(\"task-scheduler-\");\n        scheduler.setWaitForTasksToCompleteOnShutdown(true);\n        scheduler.setAwaitTerminationSeconds(30);\n        return scheduler;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.6 SSO 单点登录\n\n通过 ERP SSO 拦截器实现全站登录态校验，支持条件装配开关。\n\n```java\n// 配置（SsoConfiguration.java）\n@Configuration\n@ConditionalOnExpression(\"${dong.sso.enabled:false} or ${dong.boot.sso.enabled:false}\")\npublic class SsoConfiguration {\n\n    @Value(\"${dong.sso.sso-app-key}\")\n    private String ssoAppKey;\n\n    @Value(\"${dong.sso.sso-app-token}\")\n    private String ssoAppToken;\n\n    @BootReference(binding = @BootReferenceBinding(alias = \"BJ\", bindingType = \"jsf\"))\n    private ErpSsoService erpSsoService;\n\n    @Bean\n    public WebMvcConfigurer webMvcConfigurer(SpringSSOInterceptor springSSOInterceptor) {\n        return new WebMvcConfigurer() {\n            @Override\n            public void addInterceptors(InterceptorRegistry registry) {\n                // 拦截所有路径\n                registry.addInterceptor(springSSOInterceptor).addPathPatterns(\"/**\").order(1);\n            }\n        };\n    }\n\n    @Bean\n    @ConfigurationProperties(prefix = \"dong.sso\")\n    @ConditionalOnProperty(prefix = \"dong.sso\", value = \"enabled\")\n    public SpringSSOInterceptor springSSOInterceptor() {\n        SpringSSOInterceptor res = new SpringSSOInterceptor();\n        res.setSsoService(erpSsoService);\n        res.setSsoAppToken(ssoAppToken);\n        return res;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.7 DUCC 配置中心\n\n通过 `@LafValue` 注解实现配置项的动态热更新。\n\n```java\n// 配置（DuccConfiguration.java）\n@Service\npublic class DuccConfiguration {\n\n    // 动态注入 DUCC 配置项，支持运行时热更新\n    @LafValue(\"dongboot.ducc.test\")\n    private String message;\n\n    public String getMessage() {\n        return message;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.8 JOSS 对象存储\n\n 云 OSS 存储服务，用于文件上传与管理。\n\n```java\n// 配置（JossAutoConfiguration.java）\n@Slf4j\n@Configuration(proxyBeanMethods = false)\npublic class JossAutoConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    public JossInternalService jossInternalService(JossProperties properties) {\n        log.info(\"[ET][JOSS] 云存储Joss服务加载成功properties={}\", JSON.toJSONString(properties));\n        JossInternalService joss = new JossInternalService(JossFactory.buildInternalClient(properties));\n        return joss;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2.9 操作事件发布\n\n通过 `OperationEventPublisher` 实现领域事件的异步发布，记录用户操作轨迹。\n\n```java\n// 事件发布（PlanServiceImpl.java）\nprivate void publishOperationEvent(String userErp, OperationTypeEnum operationType,\n                                   ObjectTypeEnum objectType, String objectId, String objectName,\n                                   String operationContent, String description) {\n    try {\n        OperationEvent event = new OperationEvent();\n        event.setUserErp(userErp);\n        event.setOperationType(operationType);\n        event.setObjectType(objectType);\n        event.setObjectId(objectId);\n        event.setObjectName(objectName);\n        event.setOperationContent(operationContent);\n        event.setDescription(description);\n        event.setOperationTime(new Date());\n        operationEventPublisher.publishEvent(event);\n    } catch (Exception e) {\n        log.error(\"发布操作事件失败\", e);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. 分层架构核心代码\n\n```\n外部调用（JSF / HTTP）\n       │\n       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  client 层：接口契约 + 数据传输对象                  │\n│  PlanService / ProjectService                    │\n│  RunnerResult<T> / PageDTO / ErrorCode           │\n│  职责：定义对外服务接口签名与DTO                     │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘\n                       │ 实现\n                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  app 层：流程编排 + 异常兜底                        │\n│  PlanServiceImpl / ProjectServiceImpl            │\n│  @BootService 暴露 JSF 服务                       │\n│  职责：参数组装、调用领域服务、事件发布、响应封装        │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘\n                       │ 调用\n                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  domain 层：领域逻辑 + 事务边界                     │\n│  PlanDomainService / ProjectDomainService        │\n│  @Transactional 控制事务                          │\n│  职责：业务规则校验、聚合根协作、数据组装              │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘\n                       │ 依赖\n                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  infra-api 层：数据访问接口                        │\n│  PlanBaseGateway / PlanExtInfoGateway            │\n│  职责：定义数据访问方法签名，隔离领域层与实现          │\n└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────┘\n                       │ 实现\n                       ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  infra-impl 层：数据访问实现 + 中间件配置            │\n│  PlanBaseGatewayImpl / PlanBaseMapper            │\n│  MyBatis-Plus LambdaQueryWrapper                 │\n│  职责：SQL 执行、缓存操作、外部服务调用              │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                       │\n                       ▼\n                   [ MySQL ]\n```\n\n**关键实现伪代码（以 PlanService 创建规划为例）：**\n\n```java\n// client 层 —— 接口契约定义（PlanService.java）\npublic interface PlanService {\n\n    // 保存规划信息\n    RunnerResult<PlanDto> createPlan(PlanBaseParam param);\n\n    // 根据规划ID获取规划信息\n    RunnerResult<PlanDto> queryByPlanId(PlanBaseParam param);\n\n    // 根据条件分页查询规划信息\n    RunnerResult<PageDTO<PlanDto>> queryPageByCondition(PlanPageQueryParam param);\n}\n```\n\n```java\n// app 层 —— 流程编排 + 异常兜底（PlanServiceImpl.java）\n@Service\n@BootService(bindings = {\n        @BootServiceBinding(alias = \"${dong.jsf.alias}\", bindingType = \"jsf\")\n})\npublic class PlanServiceImpl implements PlanService {\n\n    @Autowired\n    private PlanDomainService planDomainService;\n\n    @Override\n    public RunnerResult<PlanDto> createPlan(PlanBaseParam param) {\n        log.info(\"planBaseService save {}\", param.getPlanTitle());\n        try {\n            PlanBaseBO planBaseBO = new PlanBaseBO();\n            planBaseBO.setPlanTitle(param.getPlanTitle());\n            planBaseBO.setPlanDesc(param.getPlanDesc());\n            planBaseBO.setProjectId(param.getProjectId());\n            planBaseBO.setDemandCardIds(param.getDemandCardIds());\n            planBaseBO.setStatus(param.getStatus());\n            planBaseBO.setRoleType(param.getRoleType());\n            planBaseBO.setRepositories(param.getRepositories());\n            planBaseBO.setCreated(param.getRequester());\n            planBaseBO.setModified(param.getRequester());\n\n            // 转换分支信息\n            List<PlanRepositoryBranchBO> branchBOList = null;\n            if (param.getPlanRepositoryBranchList() != null && !param.getPlanRepositoryBranchList().isEmpty()) {\n                branchBOList = param.getPlanRepositoryBranchList().stream()\n                        .map(branchParam -> {\n                            PlanRepositoryBranchBO branchBO = new PlanRepositoryBranchBO();\n                            branchBO.setRepository(branchParam.getRepository());\n                            branchBO.setBranchType(branchParam.getBranchType());\n                            branchBO.setBranchName(branchParam.getBranchName());\n                            branchBO.setSource(branchParam.getSource());\n                            return branchBO;\n                        })\n                        .collect(Collectors.toList());\n            }\n            // 调用领域服务保存\n            String planId = planDomainService.savePlanWithExtAndBranch(planBaseBO,\n                    param.getPlanExtInfoList(), branchBOList, param.getRequester());\n            if (planId != null) {\n                PlanBo planBo = planDomainService.getByPlanId(planId);\n                PlanDto planDto = PlanDtoConverter.convert(planBo);\n                return JsfResultUtil.success(planDto);\n            } else {\n                return JsfResultUtil.fail(ErrorCode.SYSTEM_ERROR, \"保存规划信息失败\");\n            }\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            log.error(\"保存规划信息失败，规划标题: {}\", param.getPlanTitle(), e);\n            return JsfResultUtil.exception(e);\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n```java\n// domain 层 —— 领域逻辑 + 事务边界（PlanDomainService.java）\n@Service\n@Slf4j\npublic class PlanDomainService {\n\n    @Resource\n    private PlanBaseGateway planBaseGateway;\n    @Resource\n    private PlanExtInfoGateway planExtInfoGateway;\n    @Resource\n    private PlanRepositoryBranchGateway planRepositoryBranchGateway;\n\n    @Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)\n    public String savePlanWithExtAndBranch(PlanBaseBO planBaseBO, List<Map<String, Object>> planExtInfoList,\n                                           List<PlanRepositoryBranchBO> branchBOList, String requestUser) {\n        if (planBaseBO == null) {\n            return null;\n        }\n        String planId = generatePlanId();\n        planBaseBO.setPlanId(planId);\n\n        // 唯一性校验\n        String planTitle = planBaseBO.getPlanTitle();\n        if (planTitle != null && !planTitle.isEmpty()\n                && planBaseBO.getProjectId() != null && !planBaseBO.getProjectId().isEmpty()) {\n            PlanBasePO existingPlan = planBaseGateway.getByProjectIdAndPlanTitle(planBaseBO.getProjectId(), planTitle);\n            if (existingPlan != null) {\n                throw new RuntimeException(\"同一项目下规划标题已存在: \" + planTitle);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 保存基础信息\n        boolean baseSaved = planBaseGateway.save(PlanBaseDOConverter.convert2PO(planBaseBO));\n        if (!baseSaved) {\n            throw new RuntimeException(\"保存规划基础信息失败\");\n        }\n        // ... 保存扩展信息和分支信息\n        return planId;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n```java\n// infra-api 层 —— 数据访问接口（PlanBaseGateway.java）\npublic interface PlanBaseGateway {\n\n    PlanBasePO getByPlanId(String planId);\n    List<PlanBasePO> getByProjectId(String projectId);\n    boolean save(PlanBasePO planBase);\n    boolean update(PlanBasePO planBase);\n    boolean deleteByPlanId(String planId, String requestUser);\n    IPage<PlanBasePO> queryPageByCondition(String planId, String planTitle, String projectId, int pageNo, int pageSize);\n    PlanBasePO getByProjectIdAndPlanTitle(String projectId, String planTitle);\n}\n```\n\n```java\n// infra-impl 层 —— 数据访问实现（PlanBaseGatewayImpl.java）\n@Service\n@Slf4j\npublic class PlanBaseGatewayImpl implements PlanBaseGateway {\n\n    @Resource\n    private PlanBaseMapper planBaseMapper;\n\n    @Override\n    public IPage<PlanBasePO> queryPageByCondition(String planId, String planTitle, String projectId, int pageNo, int pageSize) {\n        if (pageNo < 1 || pageSize < 1) {\n            return new Page<>();\n        }\n        Page<PlanBasePO> pageParam = new Page<>(pageNo, pageSize);\n        LambdaQueryWrapper<PlanBasePO> queryWrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();\n        // 只查询有效数据\n        queryWrapper.eq(PlanBasePO::getDataStatus, true);\n        if (planId != null && !planId.trim().isEmpty()) {\n            queryWrapper.eq(PlanBasePO::getPlanId, planId.trim());\n        }\n        if (planTitle != null && !planTitle.trim().isEmpty()) {\n            queryWrapper.like(PlanBasePO::getPlanTitle, planTitle.trim());\n        }\n        if (projectId != null && !projectId.trim().isEmpty()) {\n            queryWrapper.eq(PlanBasePO::getProjectId, projectId.trim());\n        }\n        // 按修改时间降序排列\n        queryWrapper.orderByDesc(PlanBasePO::getModifiedDate);\n        return planBaseMapper.selectPage(pageParam, queryWrapper);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. 数据模型与存储\n\n### 4.1 持久化对象基类（BasePO）\n\n所有数据表 PO 必须继承 BasePO，统一提供主键、逻辑删除和审计字段：\n\n```java\n// 持久化基类（BasePO.java）\n@Data\npublic class BasePO implements Serializable {\n\n    private static final long serialVersionUID = -7569943150408366734L;\n\n    // 数据库自增主键\n    private Long id;\n\n    // 逻辑删除状态：0=无效，1=有效\n    private Boolean dataStatus;\n\n    // 创建人 ERP\n    private String created;\n\n    // 创建时间\n    private Date createdDate;\n\n    // 修改人 ERP\n    private String modified;\n\n    // 修改时间\n    private Date modifiedDate;\n}\n```\n\n### 4.2 核心表结构示例\n\n规划基础信息表，承载规划核心业务字段：\n\n```java\n// 核心持久化对象（PlanBasePO.java）\n@Data\n@TableName(\"plan_base\")\npublic class PlanBasePO extends BasePO {\n\n    private String planId;           // 规划ID\n    private String planTitle;        // 规划标题\n    private String planDesc;         // 规划描述\n    private String projectId;        // 项目ID\n    private String demandCardIds;    // 需求卡片（逗号分隔）\n    private Integer status;          // 状态\n    private Integer roleType;        // 角色类型\n    private String repositories;     // 所属仓库（逗号分隔）\n    private Integer generatedCodeLines;        // AI生成代码行数\n    private Integer totalLines;                // 代码总行数\n    private Integer backendGeneratedCodeLines; // 后端AI生成代码行数\n    private Integer backendTotalLines;         // 后端代码总行数\n}\n```\n\n### 4.3 主要数据表清单\n\n| 表名 | PO 类 | 说明 |\n|------|-------|------|\n| plan_base | PlanBasePO | 规划基础信息表 |\n| plan_execute_info | PlanExecuteInfoPO | 规划执行信息表 |\n| plan_ext_info | PlanExtInfoPO | 规划扩展信息表（ARD/UI/JAPI等） |\n| plan_repository_branch | PlanRepositoryBranchPO | 规划仓库分支信息表 |\n| user_project_relation | UserProjectRelationDO | 用户-项目关联关系表 |\n\n### 4.4 数据对象流转\n\n```\nParam（入参）\n  │  app 层参数组装\n  ▼\nBO（业务对象）\n  │  Converter 转换\n  ▼\nPO（持久化对象）\n  │  MyBatis-Plus Mapper\n  ▼\nDB（数据库）\n\n返回方向反向流转：PO → BO → DTO → RunnerResult<DTO>\n```\n\n### 4.5 分页查询规范\n\n分页响应 DTO 定义：\n\n```java\n// 分页响应（PageDTO.java）\npublic class PageDTO<T> implements Serializable {\n\n    private int currentPage;    // 当前页码\n    private int pageSize;       // 每页大小\n    private long total;         // 总记录数\n    private List<T> data;       // 数据列表\n\n    public PageDTO(int currentPage, int pageSize, long total, List<T> data) {\n        this.currentPage = currentPage;\n        this.pageSize = pageSize;\n        this.total = total;\n        this.data = data;\n    }\n}\n```\n\nGateway 实现层分页查询示例：\n\n```java\n// infra-impl 层分页查询（PlanBaseGatewayImpl.java）\n@Override\npublic IPage<PlanBasePO> queryPageByCondition(String planId, String planTitle, String projectId, int pageNo, int pageSize) {\n    Page<PlanBasePO> pageParam = new Page<>(pageNo, pageSize);\n    LambdaQueryWrapper<PlanBasePO> queryWrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();\n    queryWrapper.eq(PlanBasePO::getDataStatus, true);\n    if (planId != null && !planId.trim().isEmpty()) {\n        queryWrapper.eq(PlanBasePO::getPlanId, planId.trim());\n    }\n    if (planTitle != null && !planTitle.trim().isEmpty()) {\n        queryWrapper.like(PlanBasePO::getPlanTitle, planTitle.trim());\n    }\n    queryWrapper.orderByDesc(PlanBasePO::getModifiedDate);\n    return planBaseMapper.selectPage(pageParam, queryWrapper);\n}\n```\n\nApp 层分页结果封装示例：\n\n```java\n// app 层分页封装（PlanServiceImpl.java）\nIPage<PlanBaseBO> boPage = planDomainService.queryPageByCondition(\n        param.getPlanId(), param.getPlanTitle(), param.getProjectId(), param.getCurrentPage(), param.getPageSize());\n\nList<PlanDto> planDtoList = boPage.getRecords().stream().map(bo -> {\n    PlanBo planBo = planDomainService.getByPlanId(bo.getPlanId());\n    return PlanDtoConverter.convert(planBo);\n}).collect(Collectors.toList());\n\nPageDTO<PlanDto> pageDTO = new PageDTO<>(param.getCurrentPage(), param.getPageSize(),\n        boPage.getTotal(), planDtoList);\nreturn JsfResultUtil.success(pageDTO);\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. 通用工具组件\n\n### 5.1 统一响应封装（RunnerResult）\n\n所有对外接口统一使用 `RunnerResult<T>` 封装响应，包含成功标识、错误码、消息和业务数据：\n\n```java\n// 统一响应结构（RunnerResult.java）\npublic class RunnerResult<T> implements Serializable {\n\n    private boolean success;      // 是否成功\n    private String code;          // 错误码\n    private String message;       // 错误信息\n    private T responseData;       // 返回数据\n    private long timestamp;       // 时间戳\n\n    // 成功响应\n    public static <T> RunnerResult<T> success(T data) {\n        RunnerResult<T> runnerResult = new RunnerResult<>();\n        runnerResult.setSuccess(true);\n        runnerResult.setCode(\"200\");\n        runnerResult.setMessage(\"操作成功\");\n        runnerResult.setResponseData(data);\n        return runnerResult;\n    }\n\n    // 成功响应（无数据）\n    public static <T> RunnerResult<T> success() {\n        return success(null);\n    }\n\n    // 失败响应\n    public static <T> RunnerResult<T> fail(String code, String message) {\n        RunnerResult<T> runnerResult = new RunnerResult<>();\n        runnerResult.setSuccess(false);\n        runnerResult.setCode(code);\n        runnerResult.setMessage(message);\n        return runnerResult;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n快捷调用方式（通过 JsfResultUtil 工具类）：\n\n```java\n// 成功\nreturn JsfResultUtil.success(planDto);\n// 失败（指定错误码）\nreturn JsfResultUtil.fail(ErrorCode.SYSTEM_ERROR, \"保存规划信息失败\");\n// 异常兜底\nreturn JsfResultUtil.exception(e);\n```\n\n### 5.2 分页响应封装（PageDTO）\n\n通用分页数据传输对象，用于所有分页查询接口的响应封装：\n\n```java\n// 分页DTO（PageDTO.java）\npublic class PageDTO<T> implements Serializable {\n\n    private int currentPage;    // 当前页码\n    private int pageSize;       // 每页大小\n    private long total;         // 总记录数\n    private List<T> data;       // 数据列表\n\n    public PageDTO(int currentPage, int pageSize, long total, List<T> data) {\n        this.currentPage = currentPage;\n        this.pageSize = pageSize;\n        this.total = total;\n        this.data = data;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.3 业务类型枚举（PlanExtTypeEnum）\n\n规划扩展信息类型枚举，用于标识不同类型的规划附属文档：\n\n```java\n// 规划扩展类型枚举（PlanExtTypeEnum.java）\npublic enum PlanExtTypeEnum {\n\n    ARD_DOC(\"ARD_DOC\", \"ARD需求文档\"),\n    UI_DESIGN(\"UI_DESIGN\", \"UI设计稿\"),\n    JAPI_INTERFACE(\"JAPI_INTERFACE\", \"JAPI接口\"),\n    TECH_DESIGN(\"TECH_DESIGN\", \"技术设计文档\");\n\n    private final String code;\n    private final String desc;\n\n    PlanExtTypeEnum(String code, String desc) {\n        this.code = code;\n        this.desc = desc;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 5.4 MyBatis-Plus 分页插件配置\n\n分页插件通过 `MybatisPlusInterceptor` 注册，配合启动类 `@MapperScan` 实现自动分页：\n\n```java\n// 分页插件注册（MyBatisConfiguration.java）\n@Configuration\n@AutoConfigureAfter(DataSourceAutoConfiguration.class)\npublic class MyBatisConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    public MybatisPlusInterceptor mybatisPlusInterceptor() {\n        MybatisPlusInterceptor interceptor = new MybatisPlusInterceptor();\n        interceptor.addInnerInterceptor(new PaginationInnerInterceptor());\n        return interceptor;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n```java\n// 启动类 Mapper 扫描路径（RunnerCenterApplication.java）\n@MapperScan(\"com.text.cofe.runner.center.infra.*.mapper\")\npublic class RunnerCenterApplication { ... }\n```\n\n### 5.5 逻辑删除规范\n\n所有删除操作采用逻辑删除方式，通过 `dataStatus` 字段标记有效/无效状态：\n\n```java\n// 逻辑删除实现（PlanBaseGatewayImpl.java）\n@Override\npublic boolean deleteByPlanId(String planId, String requestUser) {\n    // 逻辑删除：修改 dataStatus 为 false，并记录修改人\n    PlanBasePO planBase = new PlanBasePO();\n    planBase.setDataStatus(false);\n    planBase.setModified(requestUser);\n    planBase.setModifiedDate(new Date());\n    LambdaQueryWrapper<PlanBasePO> queryWrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();\n    queryWrapper.eq(PlanBasePO::getPlanId, planId)\n            .eq(PlanBasePO::getDataStatus, true);\n    int result = planBaseMapper.update(planBase, queryWrapper);\n    return result > 0;\n}\n```\n'''",
